<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ budget day to be June 26 - Peters' office.</title>
<headline>NZ budget day to be June 26 - Peters' office.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>New Zealand Treasurer Winston Peters will deliver his 1997/98 budget on June 26 at 2.00 p.m. local time (0200 GMT), his office said in a statement on Monday.</p>
<p>The budget will be followed the next day, June 27, by the Reserve Bank of New Zealand's June Monetary Policy Statement, due at 9.00 a.m. local time (2100 GMT).</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom +64 4 471 4273</p>
